WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.200
If your terminal lease is up,
or your rates went up — you have options.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.400
We'll source the hardware,
reprogram the gateway, and move the processing.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:13.000
No downtime at the counter,
and one bill instead of two.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.600
New POS. Same shop. Lower cost per swipe.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:20.360
Ask for the trade-in quote.
